      "message": "I wasn\u0027t clear on when I could clear the force-discharge bit, so right now I\u0027m doing it before I enable the source or sink paths. It seems like I could probably just wait for 2 ms and then clear it in the discharge function, but I didn\u0027t see in the datasheet that it was guaranteed to be done after any particular amount of time.",
