      "writtenOn": "2020-09-10T17:08:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I know this is WIP, but:\n\nWe need to test this thoroughly before making this change, we had a lot of issues with force discharge before, which is why we switched to smart discharge early in bringup. \n\nOverall I think we could get this to work, I don\u0027t think disabling discharge only when the sink is enabled will work though. We need to disable discharge once we reach vsafe0V. That is the problem we had before. It will be more complicated, but I think we need to make a deferred check to the status register to disable it once we have discharged. \n\nFor your reference, this CL is basically a revert of commit 4f748cf760dcc57b628f08ef705701235cb6c842, that has the bug #s where we had issues caused by force discharge.",
